{
  "module": "IWDG 独立看门狗",
  "moduleId": "iwdg",
  "intro": "独立看门狗: 由 LSI 低速时钟驱动, 主时钟失效时仍保持工作; 一旦启动 LSI 被强制开启, 计数器从重装载值开始递减, 减到 0 时产生复位, 正常运行期间须周期性刷新。实现于 VDD 域, 在 STOP/STANDBY 模式下仍有效。含 HAL 库(py32f002b_hal_iwdg.c/.h)与 LL 库(py32f002b_ll_iwdg.h)。",
  "files": [
    "py32f002b_hal_iwdg.c",
    "py32f002b_hal_iwdg.h",
    "py32f002b_ll_iwdg.h"
  ],
  "hal": [
    {
      "name": "HAL_IWDG_Init",
      "sig": "HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_IWDG_Init(IWDG_HandleTypeDef *hiwdg)",
      "brief": "按 IWDG_InitTypeDef 中的参数初始化并启动独立看门狗; 退出函数前会刷新看门狗以获得正确的时间基准。",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "hiwdg",
          "type": "IWDG_HandleTypeDef *",
          "desc": "指向 IWDG_HandleTypeDef 结构体的指针, 含指定 IWDG 模块的配置信息(Instance 与 Init)"
        }
      ],
      "retval": {
        "type": "HAL_StatusTypeDef",
        "desc": "HAL_OK 成功; HAL_ERROR 句柄为空; HAL_TIMEOUT 等待寄存器更新标志超时"
      },
      "notes": [
        "启动时向 KR 写使能键值, 强制开启 LSI 时钟并开始递减计数。",
        "对 PR/RLR 寄存器的写访问需先向 KR 写入 0x5555 使能。"
      ],
      "file": "py32f002b_hal_iwdg.c",
      "kind": "function",
      "src": "HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_IWDG_Init(IWDG_HandleTypeDef *hiwdg)\r\n{\r\n  uint32_t tickstart;\r\n\r\n  /* Check the IWDG handle allocation */\r\n  if (hiwdg == NULL)\r\n  {\r\n    return HAL_ERROR;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  /* Check the parameters */\r\n  assert_param(IS_IWDG_ALL_INSTANCE(hiwdg->Instance));\r\n  assert_param(IS_IWDG_PRESCALER(hiwdg->Init.Prescaler));\r\n  assert_param(IS_IWDG_RELOAD(hiwdg->Init.Reload));\r\n\r\n  /* Enable IWDG. LSI requires ready */\r\n  __HAL_IWDG_START(hiwdg);\r\n\r\n  /* Enable write access to IWDG_PR and IWDG_RLR registers by writing 0x5555 in KR */\r\n  IWDG_ENABLE_WRITE_ACCESS(hiwdg);\r\n\r\n  /* Write to IWDG registers the Prescaler & Reload values to work with */\r\n  hiwdg->Instance->PR = hiwdg->Init.Prescaler;\r\n  hiwdg->Instance->RLR = hiwdg->Init.Reload;\r\n\r\n  /* Check pending flag, if previous update not done, return timeout */\r\n  tickstart = HAL_GetTick();\r\n\r\n  /* Wait for register to be updated */\r\n  while (hiwdg->Instance->SR != RESET)\r\n  {\r\n    if ((HAL_GetTick() - tickstart) > HAL_IWDG_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT)\r\n    {\r\n      return HAL_TIMEOUT;\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  /* Reload IWDG counter with value defined in the reload register */\r\n  __HAL_IWDG_RELOAD_COUNTER(hiwdg);\r\n\r\n  /* Return function status */\r\n  return HAL_OK;\r\n}"
    },
    {
      "name": "HAL_IWDG_Refresh",
      "sig": "HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_IWDG_Refresh(IWDG_HandleTypeDef *hiwdg)",
      "brief": "刷新独立看门狗: 将重装载寄存器中的值装入计数器, 防止看门狗复位。",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "hiwdg",
          "type": "IWDG_HandleTypeDef *",
          "desc": "指向 IWDG_HandleTypeDef 结构体的指针, 含指定 IWDG 模块的配置信息"
        }
      ],
      "retval": {
        "type": "HAL_StatusTypeDef",
        "desc": "HAL_OK 刷新成功"
      },
      "file": "py32f002b_hal_iwdg.c",
      "kind": "function",
      "src": "HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_IWDG_Refresh(IWDG_HandleTypeDef *hiwdg)\r\n{\r\n  /* Reload IWDG counter with value defined in the reload register */\r\n  __HAL_IWDG_RELOAD_COUNTER(hiwdg);\r\n\r\n  /* Return function status */\r\n  return HAL_OK;\r\n}"
    },
